Package: claude-agents-indicator
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, wingpanel
Description: Wingpanel indicator for Claude Code sessions
 Lists live Claude Code sessions in the elementary OS panel, badges the
 panel and dock while a session waits on you, sends notifications, and
 jumps to the session's Terminal tab on click.
